<title>RUSSIA: Gazprom rises to 2,121.18 roubles.</title>
<headline>Gazprom rises to 2,121.18 roubles.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A stake of 1.80 million shares in Russian natural gas monopoly RAO Gazprom changed hands in electronic trading on Thursday at an average 2,121.18 roubles ($0.379) a share, up from 1,841.18 roubles at the previous session on January 10, the Federal Securities Corporation (FFK) said.</p>
<p>At a conventional auction on Thursday the average price of 5.0 million shares traded in 20 lots was 2,377 roubles, it said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
